(SECTION 3: HORIZONTAL CENTRIFUGAL PUMPS) Tj T*
(3.1 Pumps shall conform to IS 1520:1980.) Tj T*
(3.2 Each pump shall deliver 250 m³/h against a total head of 45 metres.) Tj T*
(3.3 The pump efficiency at the duty point shall not be less than 78%. Casing shall be of) Tj T*
(cast iron and impeller shall be of bronze.) Tj T*
