(RURAL WATER SUPPLY DEPARTMENT — Tender EE/ELE/48/2026-27) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3.4 Noise level at 1 metres from the pumpset shall not exceed 85 dBA.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PUMP DATA SHEET) Tj T*
(Discharge: 250 m³/h) Tj T*
(Total head: 45 metres) Tj T*
(Make and type: \(to be furnished by the bidder\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION 4: DRIVE MOTORS) Tj T*
(4.1 Motors shall be squirrel cage induction motors conforming to IS 325:1996.) Tj T*
(4.2 The rated output of the motor shall be 37kW.) Tj T*
(4.3 Motors shall be suitable for 415V ± 10%, 50 Hz ± 5%, 3 phase supply.) Tj T*
(4.4 Motors shall be of efficiency class IE3 as per IS 12615:2018.) Tj T*
(4.5 Degree of protection of the motor enclosure shall be IP55.) Tj T*
(4.6 Motors shall have class F insulation with temperature rise limited to class B and) Tj T*
(shall be suitable for S1 duty.) Tj T*
(4.7 Synchronous speed of the motor shall be 1500 RPM.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PART E — TREATED WATER QUALITY) Tj T*
(5.1 Treated water supplied shall conform to IS 10500:2012.) Tj T*
(5.2 PH OF TREATED WATER SHALL BE BETWEEN 6.5 AND 8.5.) Tj T*
(5.3 TOTAL DISSOLVED SOLIDS SHALL NOT EXCEED 500 MG/L. Turbidity shall not be more than 1) Tj T*
(NTU.) Tj T*
(5.4 Fluoride shall not exceed 1.0 mg/L.) Tj T*
(5.5 Nitrate shall not exceed 45 mg/L.) Tj T*
(5.6 Arsenic shall not exceed 0.01 mg/L.) Tj T*
(5.7 Total hardness as CaCO3 shall not exceed 200 mg/L.) Tj T*
(5.8 E. coli shall not be detectable in any 100 ml sample.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signature of Bidder) Tj T*
(Page 2 of 4) Tj T*
